# Copy to `.env.test` (git-ignored) and fill in your local values.
#
# The API test suite DELETES every row in every table before each test file,
# so it refuses to start unless the database name ends with `_test`.
#
# This file is entirely optional: if TEST_DATABASE_URL is not set, the suite
# derives the test database from DATABASE_URL in `.env` by appending `_test`
# (e.g. career_agent_db -> career_agent_test). The database is created
# automatically and the existing Prisma migrations are applied to it.

# TEST_DATABASE_URL=postgresql://postgres:your-password@localhost:5432/career_agent_test
